        "created_at": "2020-07-22T00:05:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It'll be interesting to hear from Paul! And I'm glad Adam gets to take a break/concentrate on things. Sometimes, these days, I feel like I have too many meetings to actually get anything done...</p>\n<p>I don't mind at all that they were trying to sway votes for certain topics. The way I see it, if Christopher and Adam really are itching to tell us a particular story, I'd rather they just do it.</p>",
